[
    {
        "cate": "prometheus",
        "name": "SMART设备健康状态异常",
        "note": "硬盘自身检测的整体健康状态为不健康，存在严重故障风险，需立即处理",
        "prod": "metric",
        "delay": 0,
        "prom_for_duration": 60,
        "rule_config": {
            "inhibit": false,
            "queries": [
                {
                    "keys": {
                        "labelKey": "",
                        "metricKey": "",
                        "valueKey": ""
                    },
                    "prom_ql": "smart_device_health_ok == 0",
                    "severity": 1,
                    "unit": "none"
                }
            ],
            "version": "v1"
        },
        "event_relabel_config": null,
        "prom_eval_interval": 15,
        "enable_in_bg": 0,
        "notify_recovered": 1,
        "notify_repeat_step": 60,
        "notify_max_number": 0,
        "recover_duration": 0,
        "callbacks": [],
        "append_tags": [],
        "annotations": {
            "summary": "磁盘的 SMART 自检整体健康状态为不通过，硬盘随时可能彻底失效，上面的数据有丢失风险。",
            "action": "1) 用 smartctl -a /dev/sdX 看完整属性，重点关注 Reallocated_Sector_Ct、Current_Pending_Sector、Offline_Uncorrectable；2) 立即确认该盘上的数据有副本或已备份——这是最优先的动作；3) RAID 环境下确认阵列状态，先让阵列把该盘踢出并用热备重建；4) 安排停机换盘，不要继续往这块盘写数据。",
            "runbook_url": "https://www.smartmontools.org/wiki/TocDoc"
        },
        "uuid": 1719305153888541029,
        "cur_event_count": 0,
        "cron_pattern": "@every 30s",
        "notify_rule_ids": [],
        "pipeline_configs": null,
        "notify_version": 0
    },
    {
        "cate": "prometheus",
        "name": "SSD介质磨损百分比≥90%",
        "note": "SSD闪存芯片磨损程度接近耗尽，随时可能发生故障，需立即备份数据并更换硬盘",
        "prod": "metric",
        "delay": 0,
        "prom_for_duration": 60,
        "rule_config": {
            "inhibit": false,
            "queries": [
                {
                    "keys": {
                        "labelKey": "",
                        "metricKey": "",
                        "valueKey": ""
                    },
                    "prom_ql": "smart_attribute_media_wear_percentage \u003e= 90",
                    "severity": 1,
                    "unit": "%"
                }
            ],
            "version": "v1"
        },
        "event_relabel_config": null,
        "prom_eval_interval": 15,
        "enable_in_bg": 0,
        "notify_recovered": 1,
        "notify_repeat_step": 60,
        "notify_max_number": 0,
        "recover_duration": 0,
        "callbacks": [],
        "append_tags": [],
        "annotations": {
            "summary": "SSD 的介质磨损度已达 90%，写入寿命接近耗尽，达到 100% 后可能转为只读或直接失效。",
            "action": "1) 用 smartctl -a /dev/sdX 确认 Media_Wearout_Indicator / Percentage_Used 与 Total_LBAs_Written；2) 结合写入速率估算剩余寿命，据此排换盘窗口；3) 确认该盘上的数据有副本，并提前准备迁移方案；4) 复盘写入放大来源（日志级别、频繁小写入、无 TRIM），避免新盘重蹈覆辙。",
            "runbook_url": "https://www.smartmontools.org/wiki/TocDoc"
        },
        "uuid": 1719305153888541030,
        "cur_event_count": 0,
        "cron_pattern": "@every 30s",
        "notify_rule_ids": [],
        "pipeline_configs": null,
        "notify_version": 0
    },
    {
        "cate": "prometheus",
        "name": "硬盘温度超过65℃",
        "note": "硬盘运行温度过高，会加速硬件老化甚至导致直接故障，需立即检查散热",
        "prod": "metric",
        "delay": 0,
        "prom_for_duration": 180,
        "rule_config": {
            "inhibit": false,
            "queries": [
                {
                    "keys": {
                        "labelKey": "",
                        "metricKey": "",
                        "valueKey": ""
                    },
                    "prom_ql": "smart_device_temp_c \u003e 65",
                    "severity": 1,
                    "unit": "℃"
                }
            ],
            "version": "v1"
        },
        "event_relabel_config": null,
        "prom_eval_interval": 15,
        "enable_in_bg": 0,
        "notify_recovered": 1,
        "notify_repeat_step": 60,
        "notify_max_number": 0,
        "recover_duration": 0,
        "callbacks": [],
        "append_tags": [],
        "annotations": {
            "summary": "硬盘温度超过 65℃，长期高温会显著加速磁盘老化并提高故障率，SSD 还可能触发降速保护。",
            "action": "1) 用 smartctl -a /dev/sdX 确认温度与厂商标称的工作温度上限；2) 检查机箱风道、风扇转速与滤网积灰，机房环境温度是否正常；3) 确认盘位安装位置是否过于密集、相邻盘是否同样高温；4) 短期可降低该盘的 IO 压力（错峰备份、迁移热数据）为处理争取时间。",
            "runbook_url": "https://www.smartmontools.org/wiki/TocDoc"
        },
        "uuid": 1719305153888541031,
        "cur_event_count": 0,
        "cron_pattern": "@every 30s",
        "notify_rule_ids": [],
        "pipeline_configs": null,
        "notify_version": 0
    },
    {
        "cate": "prometheus",
        "name": "CRC错误计数1小时内持续增长",
        "note": "数据传输链路CRC校验失败次数增加，可能是接口、线缆或硬盘控制器故障前兆",
        "prod": "metric",
        "delay": 0,
        "prom_for_duration": 3600,
        "rule_config": {
            "inhibit": false,
            "queries": [
                {
                    "keys": {
                        "labelKey": "",
                        "metricKey": "",
                        "valueKey": ""
                    },
                    "prom_ql": "increase(smart_attribute_crc_error_count[1h]) \u003e 0",
                    "severity": 1,
                    "unit": "none"
                }
            ],
            "version": "v1"
        },
        "event_relabel_config": null,
        "prom_eval_interval": 15,
        "enable_in_bg": 0,
        "notify_recovered": 1,
        "notify_repeat_step": 60,
        "notify_max_number": 0,
        "recover_duration": 0,
        "callbacks": [],
        "append_tags": [],
        "annotations": {
            "summary": "磁盘接口 CRC 错误持续增长，这通常不是盘体问题而是数据线或接口接触不良，会导致读写重试和性能下降，长期可能损坏数据。",
            "action": "1) 用 smartctl -a /dev/sdX 确认 UDMA_CRC_Error_Count 的增长速度；2) 停机检查并重新插拔 SATA/SAS 数据线与电源线，优先直接换一根线；3) 换线后观察计数是否停止增长——SMART 计数不会自动归零，看增量而非绝对值；4) 换线无效则怀疑背板或 HBA 卡，逐个替换定位。",
            "runbook_url": "https://www.smartmontools.org/wiki/TocDoc"
        },
        "uuid": 1719305153888541032,
        "cur_event_count": 0,
        "cron_pattern": "@every 30s",
        "notify_rule_ids": [],
        "pipeline_configs": null,
        "notify_version": 0
    },
    {
        "cate": "prometheus",
        "name": "SSD擦除失败计数增长",
        "note": "SSD闪存块擦除失败，意味着闪存芯片老化，存在数据写入故障风险",
        "prod": "metric",
        "delay": 0,
        "prom_for_duration": 60,
        "rule_config": {
            "inhibit": false,
            "queries": [
                {
                    "keys": {
                        "labelKey": "",
                        "metricKey": "",
                        "valueKey": ""
                    },
                    "prom_ql": "increase(smart_attribute_erase_fail_count[1h]) \u003e 0",
                    "severity": 1,
                    "unit": "none"
                }
            ],
            "version": "v1"
        },
        "event_relabel_config": null,
        "prom_eval_interval": 15,
        "enable_in_bg": 0,
        "notify_recovered": 1,
        "notify_repeat_step": 60,
        "notify_max_number": 0,
        "recover_duration": 0,
        "callbacks": [],
        "append_tags": [],
        "annotations": {
            "summary": "SSD 擦除操作失败计数在增长，闪存块正在损坏，可用容量会持续下降并最终导致写入失败。",
            "action": "1) 用 smartctl -a /dev/sdX 确认 Erase_Fail_Count 与 Reallocated/Available_Reservd_Space 的剩余余量；2) 备用块余量下降说明盘已接近寿命终点，立即确认数据有副本；3) 排换盘计划，不要等到写入完全失败；4) 换盘前降低该盘写入压力，避免加速恶化。",
            "runbook_url": "https://www.smartmontools.org/wiki/TocDoc"
        },
        "uuid": 1719305153888541033,
        "cur_event_count": 0,
        "cron_pattern": "@every 30s",
        "notify_rule_ids": [],
        "pipeline_configs": null,
        "notify_version": 0
    },
